<InfoBox type="warning" title="Will it arrive before Christmas?">
  Everything is made in our workshop in Sweden and posted within 3–5 business days.
  On 18 November, Etsy estimated 7–13 days from order to delivery within Europe and
  the UK, and 9–15 days to the US. Each Etsy listing shows the date for your address.
  December post runs slower, so leave a few extra days, especially for the US.
  STL files download instantly.
</InfoBox>
